    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati kūbeeja mihayo būpya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati ū ntemi wa Yuda aho washoka ū kwikūlū lyakwe ī Yelusalemu alī mhola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'hangi Yehu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hanaani ūnsūng'wanha; ūng'wīla, “Ni kinehe ū bebe nose ū kūgunanhaga babūbi, na kūbatogwa abo batantogilwe SEEBA? Managa gīkī wansaayīkije ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a hene ū bebe ūlī nabo ū wiza, nguno ī sī wīyīngīgije a ma Ashela; nī ng'holò yako īlolelile kūlī Mulungu kūnkooba we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati wikalaga Yelusalemu, hūna ūbūūka hangī kūja akūbayeeleelaga a banhū, kwandīja Beeli-sheba kūshisha kū sī ja magūlya ga Efulaimu; ūbashosha kūlī SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūūla balamuji ū mu mizengo ya Yuda ī yose īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Ng'ūyidedeeng'hanya chiza īyo mukwīyītaga, nguno mutūfunyaga būlamuji kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa munhū, alīyo kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūyo alī hamò ning'we būl'ikanza ūlū mulīlamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, bizagi na logohano lwa ng'wa SEEBA; nguno ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wise būtīho būbi nūūlū būsolaanhya, nūūlū būhongi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu Yelusalemu ū Yehoshafati ūbasola bamò ba Balawī na bagabīji, na a bataale ba ndūgū ja Baisilaeli, ūbatūūla kūbiza balang'hani ba shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, na balamuji ba mihayo; būbiza ba mu Yelusalemu ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbinha ī shilagīlo alīhaya, “Shiigelile mutūmame mu būtūngīlīja na ng'holò īmò, nīyo mu logohano lwa ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī mhayo ūyo gūng'wizīīla kūfuma kū baana ba ng'wing'we abo bakwikalaga ū mu mizengo, nūūlū gūbize mhayo gwa būbūlagi, nūūlū mihayo yīngī ya shilagīlo, malange, katongeelele, nūūlū kajīle; ng'ūbahūgūla. Yaya ū kūng'hūba ū SEEBA, nguno ūlū ītī chene numho ū būpelanu bokwe būkūng'wizīīla a bing'we na a badūgū bing'we; alīyo ūlū ng'ūbalanga, mutūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amalia ū ntaale wa bagabīji, akūbiza ntaale wing'we ū mu būtūmami wa kūlī SEEBA; ū mu milīmo ya ntemi ū ntaale wing'we akūbiza Zebadia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ishimaeli, ū ntaale wa lūganda lya ng'wa Yuda. A Balawī bakūbiza batūmami ba kūmugunanha. Tūmamagi mu būshisha ng'holò, ū SEEBA abize hamò nabo abo bakwītaga chiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
